      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to really kickstart my metabolism for a cutting phase. i've been drinking a lot of coffee all morning and i have a pretty high tolerance so i don't really feel much anymore. i want to start stacking green tea extract with caffeine to really push my fat burning. what's the max effective daily dose i can take of both combined to get the best results without it being too much? i want to go aggressive on this.",
