      "content": "400mg feels pretty low though, especially since i'm already used to heavy coffee intake. i feel like i could handle more if i'm just doing it for a short period to break a plateau. if i'm looking for the absolute most aggressive dose that still actually works for fat oxidation, what kind of levels are we talking for the green tea extract and caffeine stack? just give me a number i can aim for so i can get started.",
